    <string name="BatteryClientVpnAbout">App-only VLESS starts sing-box/libbox inside the app process, exposes an authenticated loopback SOCKS5 endpoint only to Telegram MTProto, and does not create Android VPN/TUN or a system proxy. Built-in VPN/TUN mode uses stack=system, no mux, gc_percent=200, GOMAXPROCS=2, and DNS sniff+hijack rules for udp/53. Android system-wide proxy changes are not available to a normal app.</string>
